  "entity_type": "person",
  "description": "This time last year, Kölsch was hard at work realising the vision of his live show, Kölsch & The Machine. 2026 has been defined by a continued focus on artistic projects that take him out from behind the decks, from touring the live show to performing with an opera singer on Tomorrowland’s Mainstage.\n\nHis album ‘Kinematic’ was the year’s defining project, while next year will see him turn his attention to the soundtrack for Synthetic, a science-fiction film, alongside plans for one-off vinyl releases, special events and art pieces. “I want to focus on creating something that is real,” he says. “Something beautiful, tangible, that will stand the test of time.”",
